      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baxterville%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1964, the Atomic Energy Commission detonated a 5,000‑ton nuclear device inside the nearby Tatum Salt Dome.",
